      ],
      "source": "https://www.thewoodlander.com/"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The area that is now Pocono Woodland Lakes was once home to Delaware, Iroquois, Shawnee, Minisink, Lenape, and Paupack Native Americans.",
